OL,3,AIn a year of AI solving maths problems,
OL,4,Aan Anthropic worker says he may have   
OL,5,Acracked the biggest                    
OL,7,FAn Anthropic employee and mathematician
OL,8,Fclaims to have used the company's      
OL,9,Fartificial intelligence (AI) chatbot to
OL,10,Fprove the famed Riemann hypothesis.    
OL,12,FLevent Alpoge said on Friday, a day    
OL,13,Fafter Anthropic made its US stock      
OL,14,Fmarket debut, that over the course of  
OL,15,Fabout six weeks, he used the Claude    
OL,16,Fchatbot to create a detailed proof of  
OL,17,Fthe maths problem.                     
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
